  "description": "This hardtail mountain bike is built to make off-road riding accessible, offering a confident and comfortable ride whether you're exploring local parks, cruising through the streets or venturing onto light trails. Its lightweight 6061 alloy frame with internal cable routing provides a clean, modern foundation, while the Suntour XCE28 suspension fork with 100mm of travel smooths out bumps and uneven terrain for greater comfort and control. Large volume tyres help absorb vibrations and improve grip, making every ride more enjoyable for new and recreational riders.\n\nDesigned for riders taking their first steps into mountain biking or anyone looking for an affordable, capable all-rounder, this bike combines dependable components with practical performance. A Shimano 2x7 drivetrain provides a wide range of gears for tackling varied terrain, while Tektro mechanical disc brakes deliver reliable stopping power in all conditions. It's a versatile, confidence-inspiring hardtail that's ready for everything from everyday rides to weekend trail adventures.",
